<title>USA: Applewoods names David Knight CFO.</title>
<headline>Applewoods names David Knight CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WESTPORT, Conn. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applewoods Inc said on Monday it named David Knight chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company said Knight most recently worked as the financial director of a William Baird Plc division.</p>
<p>Applewoods makes all natural soaps, lotions, oils, and other toiletries items.</p>
